{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18042","headline":"李花二首 二 · 韩愈","name":"李花二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当春天地争奢华，洛阳园苑尤纷拏。\n谁将平地万堆雪，翦刻作此连天花。\n日光赤色照未好，明月暂入都交加。\n夜领张彻投卢仝，乘云共至玉皇家。\n长姬香御四罗列，缟裙练帨无等差。\n静濯明妆有所奉，顾我未肯置齿牙。\n清寒莹骨肝胆醒，一生思虑无由邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}